WEBVTT

00:00:06.513 --> 00:00:12.513
Choose Roles and invites in the side menu.

00:00:19.622 --> 00:00:25.622
Scroll to Invite a team member.

00:00:31.405 --> 00:00:37.405
Type "newteam@example.test"
in the Email box.

00:00:44.876 --> 00:00:50.876
Select Editor from the Role list.

00:00:57.385 --> 00:01:03.385
Click Send invite.
